 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 2.695,
   "end": 6.98,
   "text": "Desperately, you kneel before the altar and offer a quick prayer for wittier writing,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.014,
   "end": 10.58,
   "text": "better graphics, more powerful computers and competent programmers."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.191,
   "end": 15.461,
   "text": "You spare a thought for poor Brother Jack, too, who apparently kicked the bucket here."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.011,
   "end": 21.301,
   "text": "After a few lines, though, you get the unpleasant feeling that something is behind you."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.501,
   "end": 22.901,
   "text": "You turn."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.034,
   "end": 25.461,
   "text": "An icy draught stirs the air."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.573,
   "end": 27.541,
   "text": "Mist is gathering in the chapel,"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.585,
   "end": 32.101,
   "text": "drifting closer and growing denser until it stops right before you..."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.165,
   "end": 34.341,
   "text": "Cold sweat prickles at the back of your neck."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.554,
   "end": 37.061,
   "text": "Shaking, you stammer, \"Oh, shit!"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.161,
   "end": 39.541,
   "text": "All right, lads, forget the bit about the writing and everything!"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.589,
   "end": 40.261,
   "text": "Just a joke!"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.29,
   "end": 41.701,
   "text": "Everything's fine, honestly!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 43.029,
   "end": 45.621,
   "text": "Just before you wet your only pair of trousers,"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.641,
   "end": 50.421,
   "text": "the cloud you had taken for your one-way transport to the hereafter assumes a human shape."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.554,
   "end": 53.222,
   "text": "There stands BROTHER JACK!"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.014,
   "end": 55.624,
   "text": "\"Peace be with you, my son!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 55.704,
   "end": 56.544,
   "text": "he says."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.858,
   "end": 62.986,
   "text": "Then he glances at your trousers, grins, and asks with mock innocence, \"Your trousers..."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.039,
   "end": 63.466,
   "text": "ahem."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.568,
   "end": 65.146,
   "text": "Everything all right?\""
  }
 ]
}
